# Line endings
#
# lib/seo/llms-full.generated.txt is written by scripts/emit-llms-full.mts with LF
# endings and diffed byte-for-byte in CI. Without this, a Windows checkout under
# core.autocrlf would rewrite it to CRLF and every regeneration would look like a
# whole-file change.
lib/seo/llms-full.generated.txt text eol=lf
# docs/API_REFERENCE.md is generated by scripts/emit-api-reference.mts and compared
# byte-for-byte in tests/api-reference.spec.ts. Pin to LF so Windows checkouts do
# not produce CRLF, which would cause the drift check to fail.
docs/API_REFERENCE.md text eol=lf
